  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b7474f16da2327d60c6eada0632bdd23c6b5cda5?download\" data-file-name=\"우주탐사 카훗질문.pdf\" data-file-size=\"695396\" data-mimetype=\"application/pdf\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHv%26dataid%3D769%26fileid%3D1%26regdt%3D20220622154656&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2Fb7474f16da2327d60c6eada0632bdd23c6b5cda5')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">우주탐사 카훗질문</span><span class=\"type\">.pdf</span></div><div class=\"size\">679.10KB</div></div></a></div><div class=\"figure-file\" data-ke-type=\"file\" data-file-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4b88aaefc3b261b30b8a82ef9d2d9a7218d95dfa?download\" data-file-name=\"우주탐사 수업 유튜브 링크모음파일.hwp\" data-file-size=\"30208\" data-mimetype=\"application/haansofthwp\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\"><a href=\"javascript:checkVirus('grpid%3D1TaBA%26fldid%3DfMHv%26dataid%3D769%26fileid%3D3%26regdt%3D20220622154656&url=https%3A%2F%2Ft1.daumcdn.net%2Fcafeattach%2F1TaBA%2F4b88aaefc3b261b30b8a82ef9d2d9a7218d95dfa')\"><div class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"desc\"><div class=\"filename\"><span class=\"name\">우주탐사 수업 유튜브 링크모음파일</span><span class=\"type\">.hwp</span></div><div class=\"size\">29.50KB</div></div></a></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\">우주 탐사에 대한 수업을 고민하다 할 이야기도 많고 좋은 영상은 많고 (좋은 영상들이 너무 많아죠.. 유튜버님들 존경해요)</p><p>&#160;영상만 보여주기에는 너무 애들이 일방적으로 듣기만 하는 수업이 될까 고민하다가</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;&#160;</p><p>1. 우주 탐사에 관한 유튜브 좋은 모든 영상 1.75배속으로 틀어주기</p><p>&#160;2. 영상 속 내용 카훗으로 풀기</p><p>&#160;(문제는 25개 만들고 관련 영상 보고 카훗풀고 영상풀고 카훗풀고 이런식으로 주제마다 끊어서 중간중간 퀴즈 진행했습니다)</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;영상 보기전에 애들보고 영상속에서 퀴즈 나오니 필기하면서 보라고 했습니다.</p><p>&#160;핸드폰 나눠주고 카훗으로 접속한 후</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>① 보이저 호 영상 1.75배속 - 카훗문제 7번</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OWmU1qJPaxE&amp;t=1s\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OWmU1qJPaxE&amp;t=1s</span></a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OWmU1qJPaxE\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"1280\" data-video-height=\"720\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/kEN87/hyOQqJh32W/R7I8hiEOkIWmerOwXYx6ok/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"1280\" data-video-origin-height=\"720\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/OWmU1qJPaxE\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>②&#160; 스피처 영상 1.75배속 문제문제 9번</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AT_bpd9Q5Lo\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AT_bpd9Q5Lo</span></a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AT_bpd9Q5Lo\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"480\" data-video-height=\"360\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/IvIa6/hyOQmtldnQ/f6hy6CPzJzGhXnmZYcnxH1/img.jpg?width=480&amp;height=360&amp;face=0_0_480_360\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"480\" data-video-origin-height=\"360\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/AT_bpd9Q5Lo\" width=\"480\" height=\"360\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">&#160;</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>③허블영상 아래 2개 배속으로 보고 카훗 16번까지</p><p>&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dI4v99wWNGQ&amp;t=425s\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dI4v99wWNGQ&amp;t=425s</span></a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dI4v99wWNGQ\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"640\" data-video-height=\"480\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/5WIBY/hyORGDnoOv/YpGS30rVEsPnfXWoyM0z40/img.jpg?width=640&amp;height=480&amp;face=0_0_640_480\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"640\" data-video-origin-height=\"480\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/dI4v99wWNGQ\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vur832hIn0k&amp;t=297s\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vur832hIn0k&amp;t=297s</span></a><span style=\"color: #000000;\">.</span></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vur832hIn0k\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"640\" data-video-height=\"480\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/qXo0k/hyOQx2lyGy/FNgSMxleOyVWbPQ1tChGa1/img.jpg?width=640&amp;height=480&amp;face=0_0_640_480\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"640\" data-video-origin-height=\"480\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Vur832hIn0k\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>④제임스 웹 영상2개 배속으로 보고 카훗 24번까지 (뒤에 영상은은 앞 6분만)</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZEHGwSa7Ypo\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZEHGwSa7Ypo</span></a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZEHGwSa7Ypo\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"640\" data-video-height=\"480\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/boXNoz/hyOQoqOHhb/MAmk4WHJPYgZU4IdoyrdSK/img.jpg?width=640&amp;height=480&amp;face=0_0_640_480\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"640\" data-video-origin-height=\"480\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/ZEHGwSa7Ypo\" width=\"640\" height=\"480\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r5xSmkxXR6Y\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r5xSmkxXR6Y</span></a><span style=\"color: #000000;\"> (앞 6분만 보고)</span></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r5xSmkxXR6Y\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"1280\" data-video-height=\"720\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/cFUNJt/hyOQkhCnjO/LbWx6P71lEvbQ31CUlEWs1/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"1280\" data-video-origin-height=\"720\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/r5xSmkxXR6Y\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>⑤<u>우주의 마지막 마지막 문제 (25번)</u></p><p><u></u><u><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DF1CB4x_XGQ&amp;t=2s\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DF1CB4x_XGQ&amp;t=2s</a></u></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DF1CB4x_XGQ\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"1280\" data-video-height=\"720\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/gBSMv/hyOQzzsAo1/dO2pyCPvxLrjv9ikgZc2u0/img.jpg?width=1280&amp;height=720&amp;face=0_0_1280_720\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"1280\" data-video-origin-height=\"720\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/DF1CB4x_XGQ\" width=\"1280\" height=\"720\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>상품으로는 은하모양 사탕.. 시크릿쥬쥬 별의 여왕 엄청 큰 롤리팝 사탕주었습니다.</p><p>이까지 하면 딱 45분 걸리구요..</p><p>&#160;<br>빛의 파장이라던지 허블망원경 실패와 수리<br>우주 팽창 망원경의 역사 등<br>영상 꼼꼼히 보고 좋은 내용들 다양하게 보여줘서<br>영상만 보는 수업이었지만 애들이 잘 기억하고<br>소름돋아했어요^^</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">이것으로 마무리 했습니다.&#160;</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">작은 아이디어 이지만 도움이 되면 좋겠어요..</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
